# Base URL of the API. Leave empty in development: the Vite dev server proxies /api to VITE_PROXY_TARGET,
# so the browser stays on one origin and the API needs no CORS policy.
# Set it only when the app is served from a different origin than the API (the API must then allow that origin).
VITE_API_URL=

# Where the dev server forwards /api requests. The docker compose Api listens on 8080; `dotnet run` uses 5132.
VITE_PROXY_TARGET=http://localhost:8080
